{"t":"Rum","s":"rum-dc3c2","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Rum_ce352a.gif","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rum</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Rum\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rum_ce352a.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/>Liquids</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.80 oz</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">150 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170909232807&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Beer_8eddda.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a vial of rum.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.80 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Aah...</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When you drink rum, you become temporarily drunk and not able to move correctly. You can also get rum by using any <a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">liquid container</a> on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Cask\">Rum Cask</a>, which can be found in <a href=\"#/wiki/Sabrehaven\">Sabrehaven</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nargor\">Nargor</a> tavern and <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>.<br/>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Magical%20Oil\">Flask with Magical Oil</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Oil%20and%20Blood\">Flask with Oil and Blood</a>, and vials of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mead\">Mead</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/MUD\">Mud</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Oil\">Oil</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a> and Tea.\n<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>\n</p>\n<table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make Rum</b>\n</p><p>To make <i>rum</i>, you need:\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Distilling%20Machine\">Distilling Machine</a><br/>\nAny fluid container like <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">vials</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">mugs</a>.\n</p><p>1. Use the fire bug on <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Canes</a> to burn away the useless leaves.<br/>\n2. Use the sickle to cut it and collect the Bunch of Sugar Canes.<br/>\n3. Use the bunch of sugar canes with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Distilling%20Machine\">Distilling Machine</a>.<br/>\n4. Use the fluid container on the distilling machine to get the rum.\n</p>\nNote: Each bunch of sugar cane provides 10 seconds of rum production.<br/><br/></td></tr></tbody></table><br/>\n<p><br/>\nYou need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Flask\">Rum Flask</a> of rum in the 'Searoutes around Yalahar' mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a>. You also need 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">vials</a> of rum in the second mission of <a href=\"#/quest/the-isle-of-evil-quest\">The Isle of Evil Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Armenius\">Armenius</a><sup>2</sup></td><td>Yalahar Trade Quarter</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Lyonel\">Lyonel</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">150 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Satsu\">Satsu</a><sup>3</sup></td><td>Meluna</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">52 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">In a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Flask\">Rum Flask</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">In a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-3\">In a Cocktail Glass.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Armenius\">Armenius</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/assassin-outfits-quest\">Assassin Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bottle%20of%20Airtight%20Gloo\">Bottle of Airtight Gloo</a></li><li>Bunch of Sugar Cane</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Casks\">Casks</a></li><li>Cocktail Glass</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Distilling%20Machine\">Distilling Machine</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Evan\">Evan</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Magical%20Oil\">Flask with Magical Oil</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Oil%20and%20Blood\">Flask with Oil and Blood</a></li><li>Functional Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/kissing-a-pig-quest\">Kissing a Pig Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></li><li>Liquids</li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mead\">Mead</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/MUD\">Mud</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oil\">Oil</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/orcsoberfest\">Orcsoberfest</a></li><li>Pile of Sugar Cane</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/pirate-outfits-quest\">Pirate Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Cask\">Rum Cask</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Flask\">Rum Flask</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Satsu\">Satsu</a></li><li>Shops</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a></l